1
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,360
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,810
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,620
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:21,960
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,480
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:32,220
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:36,090
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:39,560
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:42,810
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,560
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:49,100
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,980
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:00,360
=Episode 23=

15
00:01:02,759 --> 00:01:03,520
Oh, my!

16
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:04,879
Why has our sect lost

17
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:06,239
all its spiritual energy?

18
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:18,439
We're doomed.

19
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:21,920
The spirit vein here has withered!

20
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:22,560
What?

21
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:25,159
Don't we have a guardian beast
guarding the sect gates?

22
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:26,439
What was it doing?

23
00:01:28,079 --> 00:01:28,560
This is bad.

24
00:01:28,719 --> 00:01:29,599
The guardian beast has fled.

25
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:30,640
All our cultivation resources

26
00:01:30,719 --> 00:01:31,599
have been looted!

27
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:33,280
Even our pills and medicinal herbs

28
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:34,280
are all gone.

29
00:01:35,159 --> 00:01:36,040
Who did this?

30
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,640
Who on earth did this?

31
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,840
The new spirit vein withered in a flash.

32
00:01:41,159 --> 00:01:42,680
And now our sect's spirit vein

33
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:43,840
has been completely drained.

34
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,840
Who could pull that off so fast?

35
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:47,560
It's hard to imagine.

36
00:01:49,079 --> 00:01:50,200
Could it be Zhao Feiyang?

37
00:01:50,959 --> 00:01:51,519
Him?

38
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:52,599
Is that even possible?

39
00:01:53,359 --> 00:01:54,480
Even someone in the
Earthly Immortal Realm

40
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:56,000
couldn't do it that quickly.

41
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,239
But other than him,

42
00:01:57,519 --> 00:01:58,480
I can't think of anyone else.

43
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:00,120
(Wang Feng!)

44
00:02:04,359 --> 00:02:04,840
Wang Feng!

45
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,760
You jerk!

46
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,199
Sect Master Liang,

47
00:02:08,599 --> 00:02:10,080
why are you cursing me
right off the bat?

48
00:02:10,439 --> 00:02:11,159
Did you send people

49
00:02:11,319 --> 00:02:12,479
to loot our two sects?

50
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:13,520
Our sects

51
00:02:13,759 --> 00:02:15,319
have lost all
their spiritual energy,

52
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,439
and all their cultivation resources
have been looted!

53
00:02:17,159 --> 00:02:18,599
Across the Southern Domain
of Shenwu Continent,

54
00:02:18,919 --> 00:02:20,280
only your sect
has the strength to pull this off.

55
00:02:23,319 --> 00:02:24,159
You still deny it?

56
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:25,879
If you don't explain yourself today,

57
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:27,400
I'll fight you to the death!

58
00:02:27,719 --> 00:02:28,960
Sect Masters, please don't act rashly.

59
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:31,439
Our sect suffered the same fate.

60
00:02:31,759 --> 00:02:33,240
We're looking for the culprit too.

61
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,280
So it's true.

62
00:02:42,159 --> 00:02:43,439
Then who did this?

63
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:46,080
Could it be Nether Hall
in the Western Domain?

64
00:02:46,639 --> 00:02:48,120
Sword Immortal Island
in the Eastern Domain?

65
00:02:48,719 --> 00:02:50,280
Or the Demon Sect
in the Northern Domain?

66
00:02:51,439 --> 00:02:52,159
Probably not.

67
00:02:52,919 --> 00:02:53,840
Those three forces

68
00:02:54,199 --> 00:02:55,199
are far from the Southern Domain

69
00:02:55,479 --> 00:02:56,520
and extremely powerful.

70
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,719
They wouldn't launch

71
00:02:58,879 --> 00:02:59,879
a sneak attack like this

72
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,439
while we're away.

73
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:03,639
Exactly.

74
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,719
That leaves only one possibility.

75
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,560
Zhao Feiyang did it.

76
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,800
Zhao Feiyang?

77
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,120
He could do this?

78
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,360
The evil art he's practiced
since starting over

79
00:03:13,639 --> 00:03:15,840
lets him absorb spiritual energy fast.

80
00:03:17,639 --> 00:03:18,919
Where might we find him now?

81
00:03:20,199 --> 00:03:21,240
- Well...
- Well...

82
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,439
Sect Masters,

83
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:32,240
Zhao Feiyang has a residence
in Xuanling City.

84
00:03:32,599 --> 00:03:33,560
We may find him there.

85
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,439
Xuanling City isn't far from here.

86
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:37,800
Let's go find him!

87
00:03:44,439 --> 00:03:44,960
Qiushui,

88
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,400
once our two kingdoms form
a marriage alliance,

89
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:49,000
we'll surpass the Three Great Sects
of the Southern Domain.

90
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:49,840
By then,

91
00:03:49,919 --> 00:03:50,800
we'll get a share of

92
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,039
all the resources
in the Southern Domain!

93
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,719
All I want to do now is cultivate.

94
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,280
I don't want to discuss this.

95
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,159
Qiushui,

96
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:59,120
why do you keep rejecting me?

97
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,120
Can you

98
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,080
really not get over Zhao Feiyang?

99
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,319
That's not true.

100
00:04:06,639 --> 00:04:07,319
Qiushui!

101
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,439
Holy Son, please calm down.

102
00:04:13,879 --> 00:04:15,000
You know

103
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,839
what my daughter is like.

104
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:18,040
You can't force her.

105
00:04:19,199 --> 00:04:19,920
But...

106
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,399
I can give you an idea.

107
00:04:25,319 --> 00:04:26,000
What idea?

108
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,800
Kill Zhao Feiyang.

109
00:04:28,959 --> 00:04:29,360
But...

110
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,079
Well...

111
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:32,920
That brat Zhao Feiyang

112
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:35,680
has had a huge influence on Qiushui.

113
00:04:35,879 --> 00:04:36,759
She may not admit it.

114
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:38,879
But if you kill Zhao Feiyang

115
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,399
and end her hopes,

116
00:04:40,399 --> 00:04:42,199
with pressure from Nanyuan Kingdom

117
00:04:42,199 --> 00:04:44,040
and Tianxuan Kingdom,

118
00:04:44,839 --> 00:04:46,000
she'll have no choice but to accept.

119
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:50,879
I see.

120
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:53,439
Where is Zhao Feiyang now?

121
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,439
Xuanling City.

122
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,319
Good.

123
00:05:04,439 --> 00:05:05,199
Zhao Feiyang,

124
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,360
you ripped out my Dao Bone.

125
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:11,040
Now you'll pay with your life!

126
00:05:11,443 --> 00:05:14,969
(Lingering Fragrance)

127
00:05:18,759 --> 00:05:19,759
So you really are here.

128
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:20,879
You?

129
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:22,680
What do you want?

130
00:05:22,879 --> 00:05:23,879
I'm here to kill you.

131
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:26,519
Then do it.

132
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:28,399
Don't you want to know why?

133
00:05:28,879 --> 00:05:29,519
No need.

134
00:05:29,639 --> 00:05:30,800
You're awfully calm.

135
00:05:31,319 --> 00:05:31,839
Fine.

136
00:05:32,759 --> 00:05:34,319
Then I'll make it quick!

137
00:05:36,839 --> 00:05:37,279
Father,

138
00:05:37,839 --> 00:05:39,399
how did you get Jiang Cheng to leave?

139
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,759
I got him to go kill Zhao Feiyang.

140
00:05:43,399 --> 00:05:43,959
What?

141
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,480
Since you wouldn't do it,

142
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,240
I had him do it for me.

143
00:05:48,079 --> 00:05:48,720
So what?

144
00:05:49,439 --> 00:05:49,879
You...

145
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:51,839
You are not going!

146
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:55,480
Father,

147
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,480
If I insist on going,

148
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,560
you can't stop me.

149
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:00,720
That's true.

150
00:06:01,639 --> 00:06:03,240
I have no cultivation left.

151
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,560
I'm just a lonely old man.

152
00:06:05,879 --> 00:06:06,800
If you're determined to go,

153
00:06:06,959 --> 00:06:08,000
I can't stop you.

154
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:10,160
But if you go save Zhao Feiyang,

155
00:06:10,439 --> 00:06:12,800
I'll kill myself right here.

156
00:06:19,543 --> 00:06:21,603
(Spirit Burst Realm, Stage 9)

157
00:06:22,079 --> 00:06:23,920
You'd better last a little longer.

158
00:06:33,879 --> 00:06:34,680
No way.

159
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,720
I'm at Stage 9
of the Spirit Burst Realm.

160
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:38,279
How could I not even withstand
one move from you?

161
00:06:38,439 --> 00:06:39,319
You're too weak.

162
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:40,800
Train harder in your next life.

163
00:07:00,319 --> 00:07:03,040
Seems I take in spiritual energy faster

164
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:06,240
when I kill cultivators.

165
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:10,040
If I kill more cultivators,

166
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,560
wouldn't that mean...

167
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,079
How could I have
such a terrifying thought?

168
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:22,600
Could this sword

169
00:07:23,439 --> 00:07:24,759
really affect my mind?

170
00:07:30,279 --> 00:07:30,879
Zhao Feiyang!

171
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:33,600
Chen Qiushui?

172
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:35,399
What are you doing here?

173
00:07:37,759 --> 00:07:38,519
Where's Jiang Cheng?

174
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,480
He's dead.

175
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,120
Don't talk nonsense.

176
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,240
Zhao Feiyang,

177
00:07:42,519 --> 00:07:43,959
I advise you to leave
Xuanling City at once.

178
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:45,639
Jiang Cheng is coming for you.

179
00:07:45,839 --> 00:07:46,759
He may even kill you!

180
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:48,439
But he's already dead.

181
00:07:48,639 --> 00:07:49,399
Dead?

182
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,199
How did he die?

183
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,199
He tried to kill me.

184
00:07:52,759 --> 00:07:54,279
I accidentally killed him instead.

185
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,360
Nonsense!

186
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,759
Jiang Cheng went to
Sword Immortal Island

187
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:58,040
and comprehended
a Sword Immortal's sword intent.

188
00:07:58,160 --> 00:07:59,839
His cultivation has surged.

189
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:01,680
He's now at Stage 9
of the Spirit Burst Realm.

190
00:08:02,079 --> 00:08:03,240
How could you possibly have killed him?

191
00:08:03,639 --> 00:08:04,920
What's the big deal

192
00:08:05,959 --> 00:08:06,879
about Stage 9 of the Spirit Burst Realm?

193
00:08:07,879 --> 00:08:08,560
Zhao Feiyang,

194
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:11,000
when did you become so arrogant?

195
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,079
I know,

196
00:08:12,399 --> 00:08:13,680
you've had a hard life.

197
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,360
But after starting over,

198
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,959
shouldn't you be lying low
and biding your time?

199
00:08:17,439 --> 00:08:19,319
I've endured enough.
There's no reason to endure anymore.

200
00:08:19,319 --> 00:08:20,120
Chen Qiushui,

201
00:08:20,279 --> 00:08:21,920
you're in no position to lecture me.

202
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:25,639
I'm such a fool.

203
00:08:26,639 --> 00:08:28,600
I can't believe I still cared
whether you lived or died.

204
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:29,959
I warned you already.

205
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:32,679
Stay or go, it's up to you.

206
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:37,800
(Lingering Fragrance)

207
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:40,000
(Virtue Shines Through)

208
00:08:43,399 --> 00:08:44,080
What's going on?

209
00:08:44,639 --> 00:08:46,000
Why are members of
the Heavenly Sword Sect here?

210
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,600
And the Sect Masters
of Qingyun and Tianwu too?

211
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,039
Holy Maiden,

212
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,840
we're here for Zhao Feiyang.

213
00:08:52,039 --> 00:08:53,000
We have some questions for him.

214
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,679
Please don't get involved.

215
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,159
So, you're Zhao Feiyang?

216
00:08:59,200 --> 00:08:59,879
Answer me this.

217
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,559
Tianwu Sect was looted

218
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:03,000
and our spirit vein was destroyed.

219
00:09:03,279 --> 00:09:04,279
Did you do it?

220
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:05,360
Yes.

221
00:09:06,759 --> 00:09:07,919
And what about Qingyun Sect?

222
00:09:08,159 --> 00:09:08,840
You did that too?

223
00:09:09,159 --> 00:09:09,639
Yes.

224
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,360
So it really was you.

225
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,039
Then the Heavenly Sword Sect...

226
00:09:14,159 --> 00:09:14,879
Zhao Feiyang,

227
00:09:15,519 --> 00:09:16,200
answer me.

228
00:09:16,679 --> 00:09:18,480
Our sect's spiritual energy
and resources

229
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:20,120
were taken by you too?

230
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:20,840
Of course.

231
00:09:23,519 --> 00:09:24,200
Zhao Feiyang,

232
00:09:24,559 --> 00:09:25,639
what exactly have you done?

233
00:09:27,399 --> 00:09:28,000
Zhao Feiyang,

234
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,679
you ungrateful wretch!

235
00:09:30,279 --> 00:09:31,320
The sect has done so much for you,

236
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:33,799
yet you turned around
and looted its resources?

237
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:35,679
You're worse than an animal!

238
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,200
When I was the chief disciple there,

239
00:09:37,279 --> 00:09:39,159
didn't I make sacrifices for the sect?

240
00:09:39,559 --> 00:09:41,120
How many times did I face danger?

241
00:09:41,279 --> 00:09:42,399
How many times did I nearly die,

242
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:45,480
just so the sect could gain
more resources?

243
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:48,000
Even in my darkest hour,

244
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:50,279
I stayed with the sect.

245
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:51,840
After starting over,

246
00:09:51,919 --> 00:09:53,519
I never once thought of leaving.

247
00:09:53,679 --> 00:09:54,759
But what about you?

248
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:56,360
How did you treat me?

249
00:09:56,559 --> 00:09:58,120
You looked down on me at every turn.

250
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,720
So I owe you nothing!

251
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,679
Now I'm simply someone

252
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:04,759
who'll do anything
for cultivation resources.

253
00:10:08,399 --> 00:10:09,080
So...

254
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:11,000
if anyone's going to cause trouble

255
00:10:12,159 --> 00:10:13,039
or settle a score,

256
00:10:13,879 --> 00:10:14,360
go ahead.

257
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:20,679
I, Zhao Feiyang,

258
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,480
will take you all on.

259
00:10:29,563 --> 00:10:33,193
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

260
00:10:33,350 --> 00:10:36,020
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

261
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:39,830
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

262
00:10:40,010 --> 00:10:44,210
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

263
00:10:44,660 --> 00:10:47,910
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

264
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:51,090
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

265
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:54,780
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

266
00:10:54,910 --> 00:10:59,140
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

267
00:10:59,580 --> 00:11:02,710
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

268
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:06,080
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

269
00:11:06,650 --> 00:11:09,490
♪With this flesh and soul♪

270
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:12,740
♪I shall forge a new age♪

271
00:11:13,077 --> 00:11:16,147
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

272
00:11:16,397 --> 00:11:19,487
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

273
00:11:19,707 --> 00:11:21,937
♪At cultivation's peak♪

274
00:11:22,077 --> 00:11:25,917
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

275
00:11:26,327 --> 00:11:28,947
♪The sun and moon turn♪

276
00:11:28,967 --> 00:11:32,637
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

277
00:11:33,097 --> 00:11:39,877
♪I am the undying flame♪

278
00:11:40,557 --> 00:11:45,277
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

279
00:11:45,627 --> 00:11:48,807
♪At last I see, immortality♪

